    "font" : "Arial-ItalicMT",
    "font size" : 11.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "ABOVE: The Lynx helicopter of the SA Navy on display was a show stopper - a definite favourite for many curious families."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 12,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 421.15, 237.921, 551.434, 272.21 ],
    "font" : "Arial-ItalicMT",
    "font size" : 11.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "LEFT: Curious little minds visiting the information stall of the SANDF."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 18,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 51.063, 127.122, 200.397, 212.726 ],
    "font" : "Palatino-Roman",
    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "and information centres. The first day took off with military displays by 9 SA Infantry Battalion (SA Army) demonstrating counter-attack tactics with smoke grenades and rifle shooting to the amazement of the learners from the surrounding primary schools."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 19,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 51.063, 52.933, 203.397, 127.938 ],
    "font" : "Palatino-Roman",
    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Members of the SA Navy Dog Unit displayed the agility and tactics of their well trained dogs while the SA Navy Precision Drill Squad captivated the public with their quick moves. The Lynx helicopter of the SA Navy on display was a show stopper"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 13,
    "level" : "1",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 215.472, 169.516, 375.856, 212.726 ],
    "font" : "Palatino-Roman",
    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "- a definite favourite for many curious families. The public was amazed by the fire power of the SA Army, which had weapons and tanks on display."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 14,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 215.472, 95.327, 386.16, 170.332 ],
    "font" : "Palatino-Roman",
    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Most young people and parents were interested in the SIYANDIZA Programme of the SA Air Force. SIYANDIZA aims to develop learners through the orientation programmes of the SA Air Force and draws special attention to possible careers in aviation."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 15,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 215.472, 52.933, 385.47, 96.143 ],
    "font" : "Palatino-Roman",
    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "The Human Resources Section offered information on careers in the SANDF which included specialised avionics, combat, engineering, maritime, technical,"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 16,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 401.266, 52.952, 542.358, 212.744 ],
    "font" : "Palatino-Roman",
    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "military health occupations and electronics. Informative materials were on display as part of the recruitment drive that aimed to rejuvenate the organisation with educated and fit young patriots. One of the parents at the Mitchells Plain Festival, Ms Melisa Sergrys, said: “I had so much fun today, my boys loved all the military vehicles and the air show was my favourite. Thank you so much for an awesome vibe. It was my first time and I will definitely not miss it ever again”."
